WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.899 --> 00:00:04.539
All right, guys. For this fourth play, I need you guys to

2
00:00:04.599 --> 00:00:07.779
evaluate some things that won't show up on the stat sheet.

3
00:00:08.559 --> 00:00:09.760
Things like charisma,

4
00:00:10.639 --> 00:00:12.519
character, and passion.

5
00:00:14.039 --> 00:00:16.759
For the fourth play, we're going to dissect tone.

6
00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:21.680
Can you say all of the correct words and still provide terrible customer service?

7
00:00:22.319 --> 00:00:24.659
Absolutely. Watch this.

8
00:00:25.639 --> 00:00:27.760
Welcome to Domino's. What can I get you?

9
00:00:28.619 --> 00:00:31.340
Technically, that's correct, but let's try again.

10
00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:36.179
Hey, welcome to Domino's. How are you doing today?

11
00:00:36.919 --> 00:00:38.279
What can I get started for you?

12
00:00:39.819 --> 00:00:43.319
Same basic message, completely different experience.

13
00:00:44.079 --> 00:00:47.739
Team, it's not just what you say, it's how you say it.

14
00:00:48.439 --> 00:00:52.079
Your tone matters, your facial expression matters,

15
00:00:52.579 --> 00:00:56.279
your body language, your eye contact, all of it

16
00:00:56.319 --> 00:00:57.859
matters.
